OL,3,GNEWSAEvery detail of Isle of Man's
OL,4,Arecord July heatwave
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man has recorded its
OL,7,Fwarmest summer since records began,
OL,8,Faccording to the government's seasonal
OL,9,Fclimate summary.
OL,11,FSummer 2026 had an average temperature
OL,12,Fof 16.4C (61.5F), beating the previous
OL,13,Frecord of 16.0C (60.8F), which was set
OL,14,Fonly last year.
OL,16,FIt means the island has now had its two
OL,17,Fwarmest summers on record in
OL,18,Fconsecutive years.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
