OL,3,GNEWSAEvery detail of Isle of Man's
OL,4,Arecord July heatwave
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe season was also unusually dry and
OL,7,Fsunny, including a 24-day drought in
OL,8,FJuly and the second-sunniest July ever
OL,9,Frecorded.
